        {
          "description": "Retrieve all customer-reported outage tickets",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "GetOutageTickets",
            "handlerDescription": "Get all customer-reported outage tickets including ticket_id (OTKT-2026-XXXX), account_id, premise_address, description, status (OPEN, CREW_DISPATCHED, RESTORED), crew_id, reported_at, and eta. Results are ordered most recent first per account. Use this to check the STATUS of an outage ticket the customer previously reported (e.g. 'what's the status of my outage / when will my power be back?'). New tickets are created by the outage_dispatch_agent.",
